  "description": "Summer Operating Area: Corsica, French Riviera & Monaco, Italy - North (mainland), Italy - Sardinia, Italy - Sicily, Italy - South (mainland), Provence Coast & Marseille\n\nFELICITA is a striking 2024 built Sunreef 80 sailing catamaran, combining elegant design with expansive living areas and first-class amenities. She offers generous guest space across multiple decks and accommodation for up to 10 guests in five luxuriously appointed suites, supported by a professional crew of four.\n\nAt the heart of FELICITA lies her flybridge, a true outdoor sanctuary equipped with a large dining table, flexible lounge seating, a Jacuzzi, sun pads, a sit-up bar, and a BBQ. The foredeck features a sunken lounge with adaptable sofas and sun pads, twin trampolines for sunbathing or play, and direct access to the main salon. Aft, the main cockpit invites guests to dine alfresco or lounge in comfort, with steps leading to a hydraulic swim platform for effortless sea access.\n\nInside, the full-beam main salon is bathed in natural light, with panoramic windows surrounding a relaxed lounge and dining area. The yacht interiors blend warm wood with soft neutral fabrics, creating a tranquil, welcoming ambiance. A central galley with a sit-up bar makes this space equally functional and social. Whether exploring hidden bays, relaxing on deck, or indulging in watersports, FELICITA offers a seamless blend of comfort, freedom, and style on the open sea.",
